---
// Services.astro — 3 alternating service blocks with modern dark glassmorphic design
---

<section id="servicios" class="relative w-full py-32 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900">
  <!-- Background accent elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div class="inline-block mb-4">
        <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-2 rounded-full" style="background: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.1); color: #FB923C;">
          Lo que ofrecemos
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Nuestros <span class="text-amber-500">Servicios</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Simplificamos tu cumplimiento REP de RAEEs coordinando partners certificados, generando reportería lista para el Ministerio del Medio Ambiente.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 1: Image Left / Text Right -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16 items-center" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
      <!-- Image (left) -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 to-orange-500/5 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-video border border-slate-700/50 group-hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?w=800&q=80"
            srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?w=400&q=80 400w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?w=800&q=80 800w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?w=1200&q=80 1200w"
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw"
            alt="Recolección y logística de residuos electrónicos"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15,23,42,0.6) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text (right) -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/50">
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">01</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400">
            Destrucción de datos incluida
          </span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            Recolección, Logística y Destrucción de Datos
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Coordinamos retiro con partners logísticos certificados y manifiestos de transporte. Destrucción segura de datos o física del soporte con certificado individual por número de serie, válido para auditorías de cumplimiento normativo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Feature pills -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700/50 text-slate-300">Acta de recepción emitida</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700/50 text-slate-300">Cert. por dispositivo</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700/50 text-slate-300">Confirmación en 48h</span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors duration-200 group"
        >
          Pre-registrarme
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 2: Text Left / Image Right -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16 items-center" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
      <!-- Text (left) -->
      <div class="space-y-6 order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/50">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">02</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            Tratamiento y Valorización
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Desmantelamiento, clasificación y procesamiento de residuos electrónicos con recuperación de metales preciosos y materiales reutilizables. Los materiales regresan al ciclo productivo como materia prima secundaria.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors duration-200 group"
        >
          Más información
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Image (right) -->
      <div class="group relative order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 to-orange-500/5 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-video border border-slate-700/50 group-hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=800&q=80"
            srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=400&q=80 400w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=800&q=80 800w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=1200&q=80 1200w"
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw"
            alt="Tratamiento y valorización de componentes electrónicos"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15,23,42,0.6) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 3: Image Left / Text Right -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center" data-scroll-animate="fade-up">
      <!-- Image (left) -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 to-orange-500/5 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-video border border-slate-700/50 group-hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=800&q=80"
            srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=400&q=80 400w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=800&q=80 800w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1200&q=80 1200w"
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw"
            alt="Gestión REP y reportería de cumplimiento normativo"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15,23,42,0.6) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text (right) -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/50">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">03</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            Gestión REP y Reportería
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Administramos tu obligación REP como productor: desde la inscripción en el registro hasta los informes anuales al Ministerio del Medio Ambiente. Simplificamos tu cumplimiento normativo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors duration-200 group"
        >
          Más información
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
